<title>TAIWAN: Yang Ming to issue T$1.5 bln bonds.</title>
<headline>Yang Ming to issue T$1.5 bln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Yang Ming Marine Corp said on Tuesday it would issue T$1.5 billion in corporate bonds to finance business expansion.</p>
<p>The planned three-year bond issue has been approved by the firm's board meeting, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Yang Ming said its January sales fell 10.74 percent to T$2.374 billion, while its July-January sales rose 11.37 percent to T$19.559 billion. It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>Yang Ming is one of Taiwan's biggest shipping firms.</p>
</text>
